# local env files
# Keep secrets out of the repo. Supabase keys live in Vercel's project settings.
.env
.env*.local

# VAPID key pair for web push, generated 2026-08-09. The public half is meant to be public
# and ends up in the client bundle anyway; the private half must never be committed, so the
# file holding both is ignored rather than the halves being separated and one of them
# forgotten. Delete it once both are pasted into Vercel and Supabase.
vapid-keys.local.txt

